ce":"戚姬","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005374","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m005-0099","start":99,"end":101,"surface":"如意","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005375","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m005-0102","start":102,"end":104,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005377","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m005-0117","start":117,"end":119,"surface":"留侯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005378","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m005-0124","start":124,"end":126,"surface":"周昌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005370","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m005-0136","start":136,"end":137,"surface":"昌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005370","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m005-0168","start":168,"end":170,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005377","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m005-0188","start":188,"end":190,"surface":"呂后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005376","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m005-0198","start":198,"end":200,"surface":"周昌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005370","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:m005-0210","start":210,"end":212,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005377","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-096-zhang","book_id":"b-shiji-096","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-096-zhang"},{"id":"c-shiji-096-zhang:p006","text":"是後戚姬子如意為趙王，年十歲，高祖憂即萬歲之後不全也。趙堯年少，為符璽御史。趙人方與公謂御史大夫周昌曰：「君之史趙堯，年雖少，然奇才也，君必異之，是且代君之位。」周昌笑曰；「堯年少，刀筆吏耳，何能至是乎！」居頃之，趙堯侍高祖。高祖獨心不樂，悲歌，群臣不知上之所以然。趙堯進請問曰：「陛下所為不樂，非為趙王年少而戚夫人與呂后有卻邪？備萬歲之後而趙王不能自全乎？」高祖曰：「然。吾私憂之，不知所出。」堯曰：「陛下獨宜為趙王置貴彊相，及呂后、太子、群臣素所敬憚乃可。」高祖曰：「然。吾念之欲如是，而群臣誰可者？」堯曰：「御史大夫周昌，其人堅忍質直，且自呂后、太子及大臣皆素敬憚之。獨昌可。」高祖曰：「善。」於是乃召周昌，謂曰：「吾欲固煩公，公彊為我相趙王。」周昌泣曰：「臣初起從陛下，陛下獨柰何中道而棄之於諸侯乎？」高祖曰：「吾極知其左遷，然吾私憂趙王，念非公無可者。公不得已彊行！」於是徙御史大夫周昌為趙相。","annotation_